  NOTES
  ─────
  POPE   : F1 score reported (official POPE metric). Our Acc=63.4%, Prec=96.7%, Rec=27.7%.
           Low recall indicates strong 'no' bias — model under-predicts object presence.
  MME    : Total = Perception + Cognition. Ours: Perception=1258, Cognition=134.
  MM-Vet : Proxy scoring (substring+token overlap). Official uses GPT-4 judge.
           Capability breakdown → spat:27.9  rec:27.3  ocr:22.7  gen:21.2  know:20.2  math:7.7
  MMMU*  : Score of 3.3% is a loader bug (samples skipped). Discard for paper use.
  VQAv2  : Official VQA-v2 accuracy formula: min(#matching_annotators/3, 1.0).
  —      : Not reported by original authors for this benchmark.

